::
:: WanOS Robocopy Job Configuration File
::

::/L                  :: List Only: Dry run - don't do anything

:: Source Directory
/SD:C:\data\git\wanos\

:: Destination Directory - moved to command line
:: /DD:Z:\

:: --- Copy Options ---
::/S                  :: Copy subdirectories, but do NOT delete anything at the destination
/MIR                :: Mirror
::/V                  :: Verbose
/R:2                :: Number of Retries on failed files
/W:5                :: Wait time between retries (in seconds)
/TS                 :: Include Source File Time Stamps in the log output
/DCOPY:DAT          :: only copy directory Data
/COPY:DAT           :: only copy file Data
:: /XX                 :: eXclude eXtra files and directories (ignores files that only exist on Z:\) - opposite of /MIR

:: --- Display Options ---
/NDL                :: No Directory List (hides folders)
/NJH                :: No Job Header (hides startup banner)
/NJS                :: No Job Summary (hides the final statistics)
/NP                 :: No Progress (hides the 10%, 20% counters)
::/NC                 :: No Class (hides "Newer", "New File", etc.)
/NS                 :: No Size (hides file sizes)

:: TIMESTAMPS & SYNC BEHAVIOR
/FFT                :: Assumes FAT file times (2-second precision) to fix Samba mismatch
/DST                :: Compensates for 1-hour DST time differences

:: --- Exclude Directories
/XD
:: On local
    .git
    .idea
    .venv
    docs
	code-import
:: On Pi
	wanos_venv
	__pycache__

:: --- Exclude Files
/XF
:: On local
	.env*
    .gitignore
    * - Copy.py
	*.zip
	dhcpcd.conf
	*.txt
	*.bat      :: robocopy-sync.bat
	wanos.rcj  :: configfile for Robocopy
:: On Pi
	wanos.console.log